[Findings] RECALL GAP AT DEEPEST k
[Findings] ============================================================

  Recall@816 — v2 Semantic (live, 20M): 0.650   MiniLM (98K, local): 0.709
  Gap: -5.9 pp — MiniLM recalls MORE than live v2 Semantic at this depth.
  CAVEAT: the ground truth (goi_search_results.json) is a FROZEN SNAPSHOT of production's
  semantic results from an earlier point in time, while this run queried the LIVE v2 API today.
  This result may reflect MiniLM agreeing more closely with that old snapshot than today's live
  v2 system does (i.e. v2 may have drifted/changed since the snapshot), rather than MiniLM
  strictly outperforming today's actual production quality. Confirm with Istari when the
  ground truth snapshot was captured before treating this as a definitive quality claim.

